          "explanation": "细节理解题。根据第一段So I was wondering, what are your tips for getting organized? Post your tips below.Thanks!所以我想知道,你有什么让自己变得井井有条的建议?在下面发布你的建议。谢谢!可知,艾米在寻求让自己变得有条理的建议。故答案为B。\n39.C　细节理解题。根据第二、三、四段的时间显示,Leowas the first to give comments.所以A错误;根据第四段最后一句Amy: Great tip. I've got a board. I'll try to use it in the same way. Thanks, Leo.可知,B项错误;根据第三段The most important thing is to start studying a few weeks before the exams and not leave it until the night before!可知,D项错误; 根据第二段Recently I've started keeping a small study diary. I write down everything I need to do and when it needs to be done by.可知C项正确。故答案为C。\n40.D　推理判断题。根据 第四段I've got a section for each school subject and another one for other stuff. I use board pens to write reminders and I make sure I look at it every day. The best part is when I remove something from the board!我为每个学校科目设置了一个部分,另一部分用于其他内容。我用白板笔写提醒,我确保我每天都看它。最好的部分是当我从板上取下东西时!可知Leo感觉最好是因为他享受完成任务的那一刻。故答案为D。\n长难句　I have always admired students who hand in their homework on time and never forget to do it.我一直钦佩那些按时交作业、从不会忘记做作业的学生。\nwho hand in their homework on time and never forget to do it是定语从句。\n重点词汇　on the other hand另一方面;organized有条理的;keep a diary记日记;in case以防万一;common sense常识;make sure确保,保证\n词汇积累　admit承认;reminder提醒物,提示;section部分",
