          "type": "choice",
          "category": "阅读理解",
          "stem": "Which of the following is the correct order of the story?\na. The man warned them not to cross the broken bridge.\nb. The master touched Black Beauty with the whip.\nc. Black Beauty was well rewarded for his decision.\nd. Black Beauty refused to obey his master at the bridge.\ne. They three came to a wooden bridge, ready to cross the river.",
          "options": [
            "ebdac",
            "bdaec",
            "edcab",
            "dbeca"
          ],
          "answer": "A",
          "explanation": "细节理解题。根据“We came to a wooden bridge.…said my master, and he gave me a touch with the whip…He gave me a sharp cut and I jumped, but I dare not go forward.…The bridge is broken in the middle, and part of it is carried away. If you go onto it, you’ll be into the river…Oh! What a good supper he gave me that night! What a nice bed of straw!”可知，文章的正确发展顺序是：他们来到一座木桥前，准备过河；主人用鞭子抽打黑骏马；黑骏马在桥上拒绝服从他的主人；一个人警告他们不要过桥；黑骏马的决定得到了很好的回报。故选A。",
